(module aslVoice/voicePipeline :x [VoicePipelineConfig VoicePipelineState VoicePipelineResult makeVoicePipelineConfig makeInitialVoicePipelineState pipelineStepFrame pipelineParaphraseIntent pipelineFormatSpokenTts renderTerminalSparkline] :i [(voice/audioFrame :a af) (voice/vad :a vad) (voice/roomNoise :a rn) (voice/speakerMatch :a sm)])

(schema VoicePipelineConfig (:f vadCfg vad/VadConfig) (:f noiseCfg rn/NoiseAdvisorConfig) (:f authorizedSpeaker sm/SpeakerProfile) (:f deliveryMode Str) (:f openRouterModel Str) (:f ttsVoiceId Str) (:f minSpeechFrames I64) (:f silenceHangoverFrames I64))

(schema VoicePipelineState (:f vadSt vad/VadState) (:f noiseSt rn/NoiseAdvisorState) (:f preroll af/PreRollBuffer) (:f isUtteranceActive Bool) (:f utteranceFramesCount I64) (:f utteranceSamples (List F64)) (:f speakerChecked Bool) (:f speakerVerified Bool) (:f speakerConfidence F64) (:f framesTotal I64) (:f noiseFramesSkipped I64) (:f speechFramesCollected I64) (:f activeTtsPlaying Bool))

(schema VoicePipelineResult (:f nextState VoicePipelineState) (:f actionKind Str) (:f dbLevel F64) (:f isSpeech Bool) (:f speakerMatched Bool) (:f speakerConfidence F64) (:f transcript Str) (:f ttsOutput Str) (:f terminalHud Str))

fn makeVoicePipelineConfig speaker: sm/SpeakerProfile deliveryMode: Str -> VoicePipelineConfig
  (VoicePipelineConfig :vadCfg (vad/makeVadConfig 16000) :noiseCfg (rn/makeNoiseAdvisor -45.0 -50.0) :authorizedSpeaker speaker :deliveryMode deliveryMode :openRouterModel "deepseek/deepseek-chat" :ttsVoiceId "addie-v1" :minSpeechFrames 3 :silenceHangoverFrames 4)

fn makeInitialVoicePipelineState -> VoicePipelineState
  (VoicePipelineState :vadSt (vad/makeInitialVadState) :noiseSt (rn/makeInitialNoiseAdvisorState) :preroll (af/makePrerollBuffer 5) :isUtteranceActive false :utteranceFramesCount 0 :utteranceSamples (list) :speakerChecked false :speakerVerified false :speakerConfidence 0.0 :framesTotal 0 :noiseFramesSkipped 0 :speechFramesCollected 0 :activeTtsPlaying false)

fn renderTerminalSparkline db: F64 isSpeech: Bool -> Str
  (let [(glyph (if (< db -60.0) " " (if (< db -50.0) "▂" (if (< db -40.0) "▃" (if (< db -30.0) "▄" (if (< db -20.0) "▅" (if (< db -10.0) "▆" (if (< db -3.0) "▇" "█")))))))) (tag (if isSpeech "[VOICE]" "[NOISE]"))] (str tag " " glyph " " (intText db) "dB"))

fn pipelineParaphraseIntent rawText: Str -> Str
  (let [(t1 (stringReplace rawText "um " "")) (t2 (stringReplace t1 "uh " "")) (t3 (stringReplace t2 "ah " "")) (t4 (stringReplace t3 "ну " "")) (t5 (stringReplace t4 "э-э " ""))] (if (or (stringContains? t5 "run gate") (stringContains? t5 "запусти гейт")) "asl gate" (if (or (stringContains? t5 "run tests") (stringContains? t5 "запусти тесты")) "asl test" (if (or (stringContains? t5 "check status") (stringContains? t5 "статус")) "asl status" t5))))

fn pipelineFormatSpokenTts technicalText: Str -> Str
  (if (stringContains? technicalText ":exit 0") "All verification gates passed cleanly with zero errors." (if (stringContains? technicalText ":exit") "Verification failed with non-zero exit code." (if (stringContains? technicalText "asl gate") "Executing full seven-tier verification gate across all packages." technicalText)))

fn pipelineStepFrame cfg: VoicePipelineConfig st: VoicePipelineState frame: af/AudioFrame frameSamples: (List F64) -> VoicePipelineResult
  (let [(db frame.dbLevel) (isSpeech frame.isSpeech) (newNoiseSt (rn/computeNoiseAdvice cfg.noiseCfg st.noiseSt db)) (framesTot (+ st.framesTotal 1)) (hud (renderTerminalSparkline db isSpeech))] (if (and st.activeTtsPlaying isSpeech) (let [(nextSt (with st :noiseSt newNoiseSt :isUtteranceActive true :utteranceFramesCount 1 :utteranceSamples frameSamples :speakerChecked false :speakerVerified false :speakerConfidence 0.0 :framesTotal framesTot :speechFramesCollected (+ st.speechFramesCollected 1) :activeTtsPlaying false))] (VoicePipelineResult :nextState nextSt :actionKind "barge-in" :dbLevel db :isSpeech isSpeech :speakerMatched false :speakerConfidence 0.0 :transcript "" :ttsOutput "" :terminalHud hud)) (if (and (not isSpeech) (not st.isUtteranceActive)) (let [(pBuf (af/pushPrerollFrame st.preroll frame)) (nextSt (with st :noiseSt newNoiseSt :preroll pBuf :isUtteranceActive false :utteranceFramesCount 0 :utteranceSamples (list) :speakerChecked false :speakerVerified false :speakerConfidence 0.0 :framesTotal framesTot :noiseFramesSkipped (+ st.noiseFramesSkipped 1)))] (VoicePipelineResult :nextState nextSt :actionKind "noise-skipped" :dbLevel db :isSpeech false :speakerMatched false :speakerConfidence 0.0 :transcript "" :ttsOutput "" :terminalHud hud)) (if (and isSpeech (not st.isUtteranceActive)) (let [(nextSt (with st :noiseSt newNoiseSt :isUtteranceActive true :utteranceFramesCount 1 :utteranceSamples frameSamples :speakerChecked false :speakerVerified false :speakerConfidence 0.0 :framesTotal framesTot :speechFramesCollected (+ st.speechFramesCollected 1) :activeTtsPlaying false))] (VoicePipelineResult :nextState nextSt :actionKind "collecting-speech" :dbLevel db :isSpeech true :speakerMatched false :speakerConfidence 0.0 :transcript "" :ttsOutput "" :terminalHud hud)) (let [(newSamples (listAppend st.utteranceSamples frameSamples)) (newFc (+ st.utteranceFramesCount 1)) (samplesLen (listLength newSamples))] (if (and (not st.speakerChecked) (>= samplesLen 64)) (let [(mel (sm/extractMelFeatures newSamples)) (matchRes (sm/verifySpeaker cfg.authorizedSpeaker mel)) (matched matchRes.matched) (conf matchRes.confidence)] (if matched (let [(nextSt (with st :noiseSt newNoiseSt :isUtteranceActive true :utteranceFramesCount newFc :utteranceSamples newSamples :speakerChecked true :speakerVerified true :speakerConfidence conf :framesTotal framesTot :speechFramesCollected (+ st.speechFramesCollected 1) :activeTtsPlaying false))] (VoicePipelineResult :nextState nextSt :actionKind "speculative-verified" :dbLevel db :isSpeech true :speakerMatched true :speakerConfidence conf :transcript "" :ttsOutput "" :terminalHud hud)) (let [(nextSt (with st :noiseSt newNoiseSt :isUtteranceActive false :utteranceFramesCount 0 :utteranceSamples (list) :speakerChecked true :speakerVerified false :speakerConfidence conf :framesTotal framesTot :noiseFramesSkipped (+ st.noiseFramesSkipped 1) :activeTtsPlaying false))] (VoicePipelineResult :nextState nextSt :actionKind "speculative-rejected" :dbLevel db :isSpeech isSpeech :speakerMatched false :speakerConfidence conf :transcript "" :ttsOutput "" :terminalHud hud)))) (if (and (not isSpeech) st.isUtteranceActive) (let [(rawText (af/transcribeAudio st.utteranceSamples)) (paraphrased (pipelineParaphraseIntent rawText)) (spoken (pipelineFormatSpokenTts paraphrased)) (nextSt (with st :noiseSt newNoiseSt :isUtteranceActive false :utteranceFramesCount 0 :utteranceSamples (list) :speakerChecked false :speakerVerified false :speakerConfidence 0.0 :framesTotal framesTot :activeTtsPlaying true))] (VoicePipelineResult :nextState nextSt :actionKind "utterance-settled" :dbLevel db :isSpeech false :speakerMatched st.speakerVerified :speakerConfidence st.speakerConfidence :transcript paraphrased :ttsOutput spoken :terminalHud hud)) (let [(nextSt (with st :noiseSt newNoiseSt :isUtteranceActive true :utteranceFramesCount newFc :utteranceSamples newSamples :framesTotal framesTot :speechFramesCollected (+ st.speechFramesCollected 1)))] (VoicePipelineResult :nextState nextSt :actionKind "collecting-speech" :dbLevel db :isSpeech true :speakerMatched st.speakerVerified :speakerConfidence st.speakerConfidence :transcript "" :ttsOutput "" :terminalHud hud)))))))))

fn intText x: F64 -> Str
  (mt (float64ToInt64 x) ((some n) (stringFromInt64 n)) ((none) (stringFromFloat64 x)))
